                    <span data-lang="en">This is a web application project I developed for my APP2000 course. The application is designed to help discgolf players find nearby courses, track their scores, and connect with other players. It was built using React for the frontend, with a backend hosted on Heroku using MongoDB for data storage. The application also integrates the Google Maps API for course locations.</span>
